  <div class="footer-waitlist">
    <div class="container fw-inner">
      <div class="fw-text">
        <p class="fw-heading">Datawake Pro is coming</p>
        <p class="fw-sub">Deeper tools, breach alerts and a weekly privacy digest. New releases are announced on GitHub.</p>
      </div>
      <a class="fw-btn" href={RELEASES} target="_blank" rel="noopener">Follow on GitHub</a>
